        "title": "A privileged experience",
        "text": "Honoured to have been able to experience some of the holy and sacred Hindu rituals that would normally be performed behind closed doors for families only. Pashupatinath is te holy burial ground where all hindus live to be creamated and ashes scattered in the holy Ganges. \nWhen there, make time to learn about the culture from one of the (government certified) guides for a small fee. This helps the locals and their families, plus you dont have to read the brochures!\nIt was interesting to see the back to back cremation ceremonies through the day and it is indeed true how the Hindu's believe that death is only one stage in their lives and the body is only a medium to host a soul.",
