        "title": "A must visit !",
        "text": "Every time I come here I see some kind development around the temple. Temple area is under renovation since a decade and progress can be seen. Very clean and well managed! Non-Hindus are not allowed inside the temple area, however they can have a nice view from river side where crimination is done. A beautiful view from this point is guaranteed. Take a guide and ready to hear stories and tone around. Am sure you will love this beautiful historic place. \n\nHindus will definitely love every moment! If you have time, try to visit around 7pm when aarti takes place at river side. Peaceful and nice experience. \n\nDo not miss! ",
